1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,148
The pressure built at the low point of the season, when the entire group had two hours a week and a simple question: can we keep the record going for another period?

2
00:00:10,148 --> 00:00:16,777
“Either we pay the five families or we draw the whole thing down,” the director said.

3
00:00:16,777 --> 00:00:24,240
The difference would show up at the foot of the bank, where the water gets its first range.

4
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:29,009
The wind came off the lake and the storm took the wing off the shed.

5
00:00:29,009 --> 00:00:43,831
A dry pool of acid, a shower of hail, and a pipe with a broken collar: the restoration cost more than the sensors, and the bacteria in the wetland did not care about the budget.

6
00:00:43,831 --> 00:00:48,455
The group tried to hide the problem in a disguise of honesty.

7
00:00:48,455 --> 00:00:54,859
“A straw, a balloon, and a stool are not a laboratory,” the boatman said.

8
00:00:54,859 --> 00:01:07,836
“The oxygen in that water is the only record that matters.” A cereal of local grain, a drip of oil, and a tick of the clock kept the camp running.

9
00:01:07,836 --> 00:01:11,195
The twin pressures were money and time.

10
00:01:11,195 --> 00:01:25,222
A barbecue for the volunteers, a paste of soap and ash, and a crocodile warning on the bank: the project was long, and probably too long for the hour it had.

11
00:01:25,222 --> 00:01:33,646
The ozone and the climate range had both been added to the programme, and neither of them could be measured from a single pole.

12
00:01:33,646 --> 00:01:43,903
“We get the tongue of the river and the tongue of the ministry in the same room,” Maya wrote, “and we call that parliamentary language.”

13
00:01:43,903 --> 00:01:54,906
The next step was the bait and the splash: a small mark on the water, a photograph, and a list of the twelve things the group would no longer pretend to know.

14
00:01:54,906 --> 00:02:02,594
The period ended with the promise of an anniversary review, and with the concrete pier still unfinished.

15
00:02:02,594 --> 00:02:15,012
A flower on the bank, a neck of land, a blind corner and a cough in the night: the development of the district was written in small things, not in the storm.

16
00:02:15,012 --> 00:02:21,374
The entire group could see it and could not fix it in one period.
